OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey start in the west with
OL,6,Flow cloud, mist and fog but much
OL,7,Fclearer in the east. Widely fine with
OL,8,Fgood sunny spells once the low cloud
OL,9,Fbreaks. Cloud builds late in the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Feeling warm.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloud continues to increase
OL,13,Fand light rain develops through the
OL,14,Fevening, slowly clearing overnight.
OL,15,FPartly cloudy with further mist
OL,16,Fpatches into Saturday morning. Turning
OL,17,Fcool under clearing skies.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
