OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA fresh start with any
OL,6,Fovernight mist and fog clearing to
OL,7,Fleave a fine, partly cloudy and dry
OL,8,Fday. Feeling pleasant in the sunshine
OL,9,Fwith light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FAfter a
OL,12,Ffine, partly cloudy morning, rain
OL,13,Fmoves through late on Sunday. A
OL,14,Fpleasant day on Monday before turning
OL,15,Fincreasingly windy on Tuesday with
OL,16,Ffurther rain possible. Temperatures
OL,17,Fnear average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
